<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5400 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5400 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5400 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.4700 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     March 11		March 10</p>
<p> High			     75.4100		 75.4000</p>
<p> Low				75.6299		 75.7000</p>
<p> Open			     75.4100		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.5400		 75.4700</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     0.780		   5.920</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 March 11		March 10</p>
<p> High			     44.9700		 45.0500</p>
<p> Low				45.0000		 45.0500</p>
<p> Open			     44.9700		 45.0500</p>
<p> Close			    45.0000		 45.0500</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	    0.015		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
